From c7fca3d0549ab7a379c793e94d0d28eebd3628f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JimmyBlunt <jo@paso-music.de>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:10:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] FastLED projection onto the map (index / surface) and
 running preview on cold load (local #9002)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A FastLED Pattern only writes its own leds[0..N-1]; on a 10,330-pixel
installation map only the first N pixels lit. New per-Pattern projection:

- index: map pixel i shows leds[i] (as before; PXLBLZ_NUM_LEDS = map count).
- surface ("Fläche"): the sketch keeps its own NUM_LEDS/raster (no PXLBLZ
  defines); a precomputed table maps every map pixel to the nearest sketch
  LED (bucket grid, one-pitch radius, ties -> lower index, -1 = black). The
  handle emits that LED's L2/L1 bytes unchanged, so the packed frame and
  the router keep FastLED's exact bytes at the map's pixel count.
- Sketch layout: FastLED screen map (vendored host getScreenMaps(), sent by
  the worker), else catalogue width x height (serpentine from source idiom),
  else a square guess with a notice. Map side: sample x,y (3D: axis pair,
  default two largest extents), Contain/Fill, flip X/Y.
- Automatic: surface for 2D sketches on >=2D maps whose LED count differs.
- Persistence: `// @pxlblz-projection ...` header line (editable Patterns;
  blanked for the compiler and dropped from the artifact cache key, so no
  recompile) or `fastledProjection` in the example's demoOverrides; Clone
  carries it into the copy.
- Deck section "FastLED": Index / Fläche, fit, flips, axes (3D), detected
  raster ("64×64 aus Screen-Map").
- Preview deck: an automatic pause while no Pattern is loaded now resumes
  when the Pattern/example arrives (cold load); a user pause stays.

Checks run manually (husky cannot run here): eslint src, check:e2e-coverage,
check:e2e-locators, tsc --noEmit, vitest node: src/engine/fastled,
fastledProjectionStore, fastledStore, openPattern (all pass; the worker
watchdog test is timing-sensitive under load and passes on rerun); vitest
jsdom: PreviewDeck (new tests pass; 2 pre-existing locale failures "1,728
LEDs" on a de-DE machine), App FastLED/clone tests (clone test passes alone;
same order-dependent failure on unmodified HEAD).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
